OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FSpain has announced it is installing a
OL,8,F500-meter-long containment barrier on
OL,9,Fthe sea border between its North
OL,10,FAfrican territory of Ceuta and
OL,11,Fneighbouring Morocco after between
OL,12,F50,000 and 60,000 migrants breached
OL,13,Fthe frontier earlier this week.
OL,15,FThe death toll from the Ceuta border
OL,16,Fcrisis between Spain and Morocco has
OL,17,Fclimbed to 67, the Spanish government
OL,18,Fconfirmed on Saturday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
