CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FAuthorities explained this figure
OL,8,Fincluded both those who drowned and
OL,9,Fsome who were killed in a stampede to
OL,10,Fcross a breakwater barrier.
OL,12,FA handful of exhausted migrants who
OL,13,Fswam to Ceuta's urban Tarajal beach
OL,14,FSaturday morning were met by soldiers
OL,15,Fwho escorted them back across the
OL,16,Fborder. Spain's interior ministry says
OL,17,Fthe majority of those who entered the
OL,18,FSpanish territory in North Africa have
OL,19,Falready returned to Morocco.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
