CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FAfter days of chaos and streets packed
OL,8,Fwith people who had hoped for a better
OL,9,Flife in Spain, residents of Ceuta woke
OL,10,Fup on Saturday to an uneasy calm.
OL,12,FEven so, security for residents of the
OL,13,Fautonomous city of 84,000 remained
OL,14,Fbruised.
OL,16,F"Life in this city has been disrupted
OL,17,Fas a result of the border incident,"
OL,18,Fsaid Ceuta's President Juan Jesus
OL,19,FVivas.
OL,26,@xD@AOUyD@dO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
