PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,F"The return of people has begun
OL,8,Fsatisfactorily, but the process must
OL,9,Fbe completed," he said. "The city has
OL,10,Fnot yet returned to normal."
OL,12,FIn Morocco, at Tangier's main railway
OL,13,Fstation, migrants back from Ceuta or
OL,14,Fwho had hoped to reach the European
OL,15,FUnion slept on the ground, exhausted.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@NO]qD@YOUrD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
