OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,F"I tried to cross, but I failed. I
OL,8,Fstayed near the border with Ceuta for
OL,9,Ftwo days, but I couldn't find anything
OL,10,Fto eat," said Abdalah, a hopeful
OL,11,Fmigrant who asked that his last name
OL,12,Fnot be published out of fear of
OL,13,Fretaliation for trying to cross
OL,14,Fillegally.
OL,16,FOn the road leading to the Moroccan
OL,17,Ftown of Fnideq, which borders Ceuta,
OL,18,Fmany migrants were seen walking toward
OL,19,Fthe fence, some barefoot, apparently
OL,20,Fhoping to try their luck.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
