PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FTaxi drivers and bus operators were
OL,8,Frefusing to take them, fearing
OL,9,Fretaliation from authorities.
OL,11,FPolice officers were deployed along
OL,12,Fthe road, stopping and checking every
OL,13,Fvehicle heading toward Fnideq.
OL,15,FBut some who had made it to Ceuta were
OL,16,Fdetermined to stay. Among them was
OL,17,FMohamed Hatri, a 23-year-old Moroccan.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
