OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,F"They've closed everything down so
OL,8,Fthat we can't buy anything to eat, to
OL,9,Fforce us to return to our country," he
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,F"But even if they close it down ...
OL,13,Fwe're round to stay here, whether
OL,14,Fwe're hungry or not."
