OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FSpain's Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez
OL,8,Fvisited Ceuta on Friday and condemned
OL,9,Fthe border breach, which he described
OL,10,Fas "a violation of Spain's territorial
OL,11,Fintegrity".
OL,13,FSanchez blamed human smugglers for the
OL,14,Fcrisis, saying they "deceive so many
OL,15,Fyoung people, and ultimately lead many
OL,16,Fof them to their deaths ` whether in
OL,17,Fthe ocean or, as in this case, at
OL,18,FSpain's border in the autonomous city
OL,19,Fof Ceuta".
OL,26,@oD@_rprD@DOUsD@JO]uD@BrpvD@UOU{D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FThe chaos has sparked numerous
OL,8,Fresponses from other European leaders.
OL,10,FIn response to the crisis, Italian
OL,11,FPremier Giorgia Meloni suspended
OL,12,FItaly's open-border Schengen agreement
OL,13,Fwith Spain for maritime and air
OL,14,Ftravel, reintroducing border controls.
OL,16,FShe said Italy was also ready to
OL,17,Fsupport any European initiative that
OL,18,Fwould assist Spain.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FThe head of the EU's foreign affairs,
OL,8,FJosep Borrell, dismissed the idea,
OL,9,Fsaying nothing in the Schengen
OL,10,Fagreement allows member states to
OL,11,Ftemporarily suspend access.
OL,13,FUS President Donald Trump weighed in
OL,14,Fon the crisis on Friday, saying "it
OL,15,Flooks like an invasion of a country".
OL,17,FAndy Burnham has confirmed that the UK
OL,18,Fgovernment is working with the Spanish
OL,19,Fauthorities to provide support and
OL,20,Fsaid he understood people's concerns
OL,21,Fabout the scenes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31311
