CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785664090
OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FFrench Interior Minister Laurent Nunez
OL,8,Fsaid France would strengthen border
OL,9,Fchecks with Spain, writing on X that
OL,10,Fhe had activated the Rapid
OL,11,FIntervention Border Force.
OL,13,FAsked about migrant crossings
OL,14,Fthroughout Europe, including over the
OL,15,FEnglish Channel to the UK, Burnham
OL,16,Fsaid: "It's a concerning situation, I
OL,17,Fknow people will see those scenes and
OL,18,Fwant something more to be done."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
