OL,3,CSpain to build border fence, after
OL,4,CCeuta migrant death toll rises to over
OL,5,C65
OL,7,FLocal authorities in Ceuta had asked
OL,8,Fthe central government in Madrid for
OL,9,Freinforcements to manage a border
OL,10,Fcrisis that had been building up
OL,11,Fbefore boiling over on Thursday with
OL,12,Flarge crowds of people breaching the
OL,13,Fborder fence.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
